B.alM=new A.F_("2. Refund Policy",'All purchases made on Nookly are final and non-refundable. This includes:\n\n- Subscription fees (Monthly, Quarterly, or Yearly).\n- One-time purchases (e.g., Boosts, Credits, or Virtual Gifts).\n- Unused portions of a subscription.\n\nExceptions: Refunds will only be considered under the following limited circumstances:\n\n- Technical Error: If a technical glitch on our end resulted in multiple charges for the same transaction.\n- Legal Mandates: If local laws in your jurisdiction require a mandatory "cooling-off" period or refund window, we will honor those specific legal requirements.',null)
